// accepts any minor of its own major (unknown fields are ignored per
// proto3); the host supports majors N and N-1. The first CTRL frame from the
// host MUST be Hello, and the first EVT frame MUST be Subscribe. Anything
// else before that gets Error{UNSUPPORTED_VERSION or MALFORMED} and a close.
//
